2026-07-27T07:55:19.0848444Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:55:19.0849579Z i /tmp/RtmpWEnLSl/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:55:19.0849989Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:55:19.0850688Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:55:19.0851254Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:55:19.0851867Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:55:19.0852766Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:55:19.0853447Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:55:19.1077739Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:55:19.1186940Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:55:19.1592431Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:55:19.1740026Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
